    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "##Exploration 2: Public Profile Safety\r\n\r\n**Inquiry Question**:  How does an AI use pattern recognition based on public profile data?\r\n\r\n1. Examine the list of 15 data points for the fictional student, Javier. Sort them into three categories: public, private, and sensitive\r\n2. Practice anonymizing private data to make it less specific and more general (\"JavierG_Oakwood_Middle\" > \"user name\").\r\n\r\n\r\n",
